 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add a `dotenv check` command that lists keys present in an example file (`--example`, default `.env.example` next to the `.env` file) but missing from the `.env` file, and exits with code 1 if any are missing
+- Add a `dotenv diff A B` command that lists keys only in A (`<`), keys only in B (`>`) and keys whose values differ (`~`), printing key names only, and exits with code 1 if the files differ
+
 ### Fixed
 
 - Fix a package build deprecation warning caused by a non-string `license` value in `pyproject.toml` by [@kurtmckee] in [#648]
